Your financial plan has been refreshed based on the life change you reported.

Life event:
{{ $('Validate Plan AI Output').first().json.life_event }}

Updated sections:
{{ ($('Validate Plan AI Output').first().json.sections || []).map(section => section.section_name).join('\n') }}

Summary:
{{ $('Validate Plan AI Output').first().json.overall_summary || 'The affected sections of your financial plan were refreshed.' }}

Additional information that may require your review:
{{ (($('Validate Plan AI Output').first().json.additional_information_needed || []).join('\n')) || 'No additional information was requested.' }}

Previous plan information has been preserved in the plan history.

Please review your updated financial plan.

Thank you.
